# LF in the repo AND in the working tree, on every platform.
# Biome enforces `lineEnding: "lf"` (biome.json), so a Windows checkout with the default
# `core.autocrlf=true` fails `bun run lint` on all 331 files at once — every line reads as
# changed. Pinning `eol=lf` overrides the user's autocrlf for this repo, no per-clone config.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.crx binary
*.zip binary
*.pem binary
